<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    The plans of release C's peoples' towns (docs/design/peoples.md, "Release C"; the format is in Rimfolk_TownPlans.xml's
    header; Source/ColonyCouncil/Peoples/PeopleTowns.cs places them). Only the base game's buildings, so every plan stands
    without the DLCs; the tests check every plan (Tools/Tests/PeoplesTests.cs). A new mark here, "dock": the river folk's
    landing looks for a place where most of its docks reach into the water, and lays them as a jetty (the game's bridge)
    where they do and as planks on dry ground where they don't.
  -->

  <ColonyCouncil.TownPlanDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Plan_ShrineHostel</defName>
    <label>shrine and hostel</label>
    <description>The pilgrim fellowship's shrine and hostel: a flagstone court ringed by columns, with flower beds and the shrine's flame between two lamps, and below it the hostel: a dormitory of twelve bedrolls, a refectory of four tables, the hosteller's room and the storehouse.</description>
