    <label>landing-pad market</label>
    <description>The spacer enclave's market: a landing pad of concrete in a ring of paved tiles with its centre marked, a paved market square with ten stalls round the orbital trade beacon, the factors' house with its comms console, and a long storehouse of shelves.</description>
